# Styling

- Tailwind v4 CSS-first config in src/index.css (@theme inline)
- Do NOT introduce tailwind.config.js
- Semantic CSS variables for brand tokens - never hardcode hex colors
- cn() utility for class composition (clsx + tailwind-merge)
- shadcn/ui New York variant - reuse existing src/components/ui/* before creating new
- Geist fonts (bundled locally), Lucide React icons
- Popup constrained to ~400px width
